===Etymology===
From [[w:Pantechnicon|Pantechnicon]], a building in London.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{UK|archaic}} A [[depository]] or place where all sorts of manufactured articles are collected for sale. 
# {{UK|archaic}} An [[eclectic]] [[collection]].
# {{UK}} A van, especially a removal [[van]]. From the shortening of {{term|pantechnicon van}}.

